OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThere are 'many in the DUP' who
OL,4,Ashare my view over Drumcree - Lockhart
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarla Lockhart has said there are "many
OL,7,Fin the DUP" who share her view that
OL,8,Fthere needed to be "profound
OL,9,Fconsequences" after the fall-out over
OL,10,FDrumcree parading dispute.
OL,12,FLockhart quit the party after leader
OL,13,FGavin Robinson stopped short of her
OL,14,Fcall to force First Minister Michelle
OL,15,FO'Neill from office over her
OL,16,Finvolvement in protests on the Garvaghy
OL,17,FRoad, which blocked a contentious
OL,18,FOrange Order parade from passing along
OL,19,Fthe mainly nationalist street.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
