OL,3,GNEWSAThere are 'many in the DUP' who
OL,4,Ashare my view over Drumcree - Lockhart
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Upper Bann MP left the party on a
OL,7,F"point of principle" and said unionists
OL,8,Fneed a "fresh new grassroots movement,"
OL,9,Fin order to see unionism "off its
OL,10,Fknees".
OL,12,FShe is continuing in the Commons as an
OL,13,Findependent unionist.
